\par\par \b \uc2 Hong Kong dollar remains strong on capital inflows\b0\par\par\uc2 564 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 2009\par 08:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2   HONG KONG, Oct 22 (Reuters) - The following is a snapshot of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                            Latest           Previous Day\par                            At 0502 GMT      At 0524 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT <HKD=>           7.7500/01        7.7500/01\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month <HKD3M=>       -50/-46          -47/-44\par  Six-month <HKD6M=>        -111/-105         -99/-94\par  One-year <HKD1Y=>         -220/-210        -201/-193\par  INTERBANK RATES (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight <HKDOND=>       0.005/0.05       0.005/0.05\par  One-month <HKD1MD=>       0.04/0.09        0.06/0.10\par  Three-month <HKD3MD=>     0.10/0.19        0.10/0.20\par  Six-month <HKD6MD=>       0.35/0.47        0.38/0.48\par  One-year <HKD1YD=>        0.75/0.79        0.70/0.80\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  For more live quotes of forwards and interbank rates, click on <HKDF=>.\par \par \uc2  * Persistent capital inflows have kept the Hong Kong dollar <HKD=> hovering at the top of its trading band against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2  * The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday, selling HK$5.038 billion ($650 million) for U.S. dollars to stem a rise in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and keep it within its fixed trading band. [ID:nHKG240188]\par \par \uc2    So far this month, the HKMA has injected more than HK$60 billion into the territory's banking system, including Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  *  Dealers said the Hong Kong dollar was likely to remain strong as investors were pouring money in Hong Kong's asset market on views of a weak U.S. dollar with a low interest rate environment, and optimism over China's economic outlook. That would force the HKMA to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, they said.\par \par \uc2  * \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gross domestic product accelerated to 8.9 percent in the third quarter from 7.9 percent in the April-June period. [ID:nSP27740]\par \par \uc2    It is hoped that Hong Kong would benefit from China's economic growth, dealers said.\par \par \uc2  * The U.S. dollar index <.DXY>, a gauge of its performace against six major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was at 75.224 on Thursday, having hit a 14-month low of 74.94 on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2  * The Hong Kong dollar is pegged at 7.80 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85. The HKMA is usually obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hits 7.75 or 7.85.\par \par \uc2  * Local interbank rates extended their decline on rising interbank liquidity after the HKMA's frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg.\par \par \uc2    One-month Hibor <HIHKD1MD=> was fixed at 0.09000 percent, softening from Wednesday's 0.09929 percent.\par \par \uc2    Three-month Hibor <HIHKD3MD=> fell to 0.18857 percent, its lowest level since Nov. 2004, and down from the previous session's 0.19786 percent.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The aggregate balance -- the sum of balances on clearing\par accounts maintained by banks with the HKMA -- will increase to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HK$222.816 billion by Oct. 27.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  * The Hong Kong government will release consumer price index\par (CPI) data for September at 0830 GMT.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  MARKET/ECONOMIC NEWS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  > Stock market reports and updates:                       [.HK]\par  > Yuan reports and updates:                              [CNY/]\par  > U.S. dollar reports and updates:                [USD/] [FRX/]\par  > Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reports and updates:           [EMRG/FRX]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  (Reporting by Christina Lo; Editing by Jonathan Hopfner)\par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-HONGKONG/FORWARDS|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|Z|ABX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PCM|PEN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091025e5am0002e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
